      "functional_impact_measured": "Transgenic mouse line was viable and used for in vivo surface-labeling experiments; surface display of the 3xFLAG-tagged GDE2 was confirmed by immunostaining in intact tissue. Enzymatic or signaling function of the tagged protein was NOT MEASURED explicitly in the cited clips.",
